            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thai",
            "review_text": "G3mm8\nWhittlesey, United Kingdom580 contributions\n0\nWouldn’t go back!!\nJan 2026 • Family\nArrived and greeted nicely by staff, seated and order taken. Drinks came out quickly and food came out shortly after!! Food tasted good but not quite what we expected we have had better tasting Thai food!! The biggest shock was when the kitchen staff walked through the restaurant pass paying, dinning customers eating their food, with wheelie bins full of rubbish to take to the street!! After a few minutes they then walked back in via the front door pass us customers with the same wheelie bins but now they had been emptied!!! I am guessing they don’t have a back door for their rubbish but this cants surely be OK!!!\nRead more\nWritten January 9, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
