            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thai",
            "review_text": "Venture12389617706\n1 contribution\n0\nChilli Thai\nOct 2025 • Friends\nChilli Thai is highly praised for its authentic and flavorful Thai dishes, especially the Tom Yum soup and Pad Thai. The restaurant offers a wide variety of dishes, including vegetarian and vegan options, which many customers appreciate. The atmosphere is cozy, clean, and beautifully decorated, creating a relaxing dining experience. Staff members are friendly, helpful, and attentive, making guests feel welcome. Prices are considered reasonable for the quality of food and service. Many diners describe Chilli Thai as a great place to enjoy delicious Thai cuisine in a comfortable and inviting setting.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 7, 2025",
